      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salinas%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Boronda Adobe, a California Historical Landmark, now houses a museum that tells Salinas' early history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salinas%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "John Steinbeck's childhood home, just two blocks from his birthplace, now serves as a restaurant in Salinas.",
